            </note>
            <note corresp="#d414-f3" n="1" xml:id="d414-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d414-f4" n="2" xml:id="d414-f4-content">
                <p>This telegram was repeated to Berlin, London, and Vienna. Count Bernadotte did
                    not reply until August 3, when he advised that he did not intend to send
                    observer’s to the American zones of Germany and Austria because of the necessity
                    of concentrating them in the Middle East (telegram 1096, August 4, 6 p. m., from
                    Cairo, 501.BB Palestine/8–448).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
